// Carrion Concord buildings, baked into assets/buildings/concord.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release -- --config assets-src/buildings/concord.ron --out assets/buildings/concord.pak`).
// Each building has four models: its construction stages `#1` (foundation), `#2` (frame) and `#3`
// (nearly done), then the finished building under its own name, exactly as in data/rosters.
// Tier upgrades (Exchange, Grand Bourse) have only `#3` and the finished model.
// All four share one texture set (one material) and keep their authored positions in tiles
// (`keep_origin`), with the origin at the middle of the footprint on the ground and the door
// facing +z. Sources and scripts: the project's design/buildings/ folder (docs/21-buildings.md).
